<title>CANADA: Canadian AirCargo offers flood relief.</title>
<headline>Canadian AirCargo offers flood relief.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian AirCargo said it will offer special discounts for personal relief shipments destined for victims of massive flooding in Manitoba province's southern Red River Valley.</p>
<p>The airline said it has created a special guaranteed space, flight specific product for private packages destined to families and friends in Winnipeg, centre of the afflicted region. Rates are more than 50 percent off the normal guaranteed priority rates. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017</p>
</text>
